+
+## Workflow tool configuration
+
+Every `agent()` call inside a `Workflow` gets `model: 'sonnet'` explicitly. Opus fleets exhaust the
+session limit mid-run and void completed work. Escalate one stage only when that stage is the hard one.
+
+Full rules (structure guards, fact-sheet completeness, agent budgeting) live in
+`~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` under "Workflow tool — standing configuration", which is where they survive
+`node update-system.mjs apply`. **This file is in `update-system.mjs`'s managed list and gets
+overwritten on update; treat the copy here as a pointer, not the source.**
